173	 * invoice that doesn't yet have a commission row and whose owner is attached to a
174	 * partner. This is the DURABLE hook — it covers every charge path uniformly
175	 * (initial orders, all renewals, upgrades, add-ons, domain/email/hosting/nxcloud
176	 * renewals) without each charge site needing to know about the partner program,
177	 * and it self-heals any charge the inline hooks missed. Idempotent.
